      "text": "I’d choose the Aeroplan economy award via Hong Kong: among the shown awards, it arrives earliest and has the shortest elapsed time. The tradeoff is an evening departure and a 105-minute connection; award cabin is reported as economy, but cabin by leg was not provided.",
